    <item>
      <title>Mailing Lists</title>
      <link>/community/mailing-lists/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/community/mailing-lists/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Ask questions, post your requests, hang out with project committers, or lurk and watch the community at work. You need to subscribe before you can post!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;table&gt;&#xA;  &lt;thead&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Name&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Functions&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/thead&gt;&#xA;  &lt;tbody&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;user@&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;If you use Nutch, please subscribe to the Nutch user mailing list.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;mailto:user-subscribe@nutch.apache.org&#34;&gt;subscribe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/br&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:user-unsubscribe@nutch.apache.org&#34;&gt;unsubscribe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/br&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://lists.apache.org/list.html?user@nutch.apache.org&#34;&gt;search list&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/br&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.mail-archive.com/nutch-user%40lucene.apache.org/&#34;&gt;search old list archive&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;dev@&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;If you&amp;rsquo;d like to contribute to Nutch, please subscribe to the Nutch developer mailing list.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;mailto:dev-subscribe@nutch.apache.org&#34;&gt;subscribe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/br&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:dev-unsubscribe@nutch.apache.org&#34;&gt;unsubscribe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/br&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://lists.apache.org/list.html?dev@nutch.apache.org&#34;&gt;search list&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/br&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.mail-archive.com/nutch-dev%40lucene.apache.org/&#34;&gt;search old list archive&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;commits@&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;If you&amp;rsquo;d like to see changes made in the version control system then subscribe to the Nutch commit mailing list.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;mailto:commits-subscribe@nutch.apache.org&#34;&gt;subscribe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/br&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:commits-unsubscribe@nutch.apache.org&#34;&gt;unsubscribe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/br&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://lists.apache.org/list.html?commits@nutch.apache.org&#34;&gt;search list&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/br&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.mail-archive.com/nutch-commits%40lucene.apache.org/&#34;&gt;search old list archive&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;agent@&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;If you use Nutch to perform extensive crawls of sites that you do not control, please subscribe to the Nutch agent mailing list. This is where we encourage webmasters to post questions about the Nutch crawler.&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;mailto:agent-subscribe@nutch.apache.org&#34;&gt;subscribe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/br&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:agent-unsubscribe@nutch.apache.org&#34;&gt;unsubscribe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/br&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://lists.apache.org/list.html?agent@nutch.apache.org&#34;&gt;search list&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/br&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.mail-archive.com/nutch-agent%40lucene.apache.org/&#34;&gt;search old list archive&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/tbody&gt;&#xA;&lt;/table&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Merchandise</title>
      <link>/community/merchandise/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/community/merchandise/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.cafepress.com/nutch&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;https://www.cafepress.com/nutch&lt;/a&gt; for some cool nutch merch!&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;All profits from sales of these products are donated to &lt;a href=&#34;https://apache.org&#34;&gt;The Apache Software Foundation&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The Apache Nutch logo and mascot were designed and donated to Apache by Thomas Deichsel of Media Style GmbH.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The name &amp;ldquo;Apache Nutch&amp;rdquo; and depictions of the Apache Nutch logo and mascot are reserved for use by The Apache Software Foundation.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>People &amp; Credits</title>
